<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.1 bln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.1 bln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction March 25 versus March 18:</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   172/179	  351/358</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   No bids	  3.50/3.35</p>
<p> Highest yld     accepted	 3.50/3.35</p>
<p> Lowest  yld			  3.47/3.34</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million		    1,118/170</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    195/150	1,168/253</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 45,121 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
